WEBVTT

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.206
što znači da se stalno tresem.

00:00:31.206 --> 00:00:34.053
Pogledajte!

00:00:34.053 --> 00:00:37.460
Baš zamorno! Kao miks Shakire, Shakire

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:39.240
i Muhammada Alija.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.236
(Smijeh)

00:00:42.236 --> 00:00:44.231
Cerebralna paraliza nije genetski uvjetovana.

00:00:44.231 --> 00:00:47.015
Nije urođena mana i nije zarazna.

00:00:47.015 --> 00:00:50.435
Nitko nije bacio urok na utrobu moje majke

00:00:50.435 --> 00:00:53.671
i nisam je dobila zato
što su mi roditelji u rodu,

00:00:53.671 --> 00:00:55.172
iako jesu.

00:00:55.172 --> 00:00:59.241
(Smijeh)

00:00:59.241 --> 00:01:01.595
Ona je isključivo rezultat nezgode,